{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0265","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000000f4:text","row":36095,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"と、一人で屋上に来たのはいいが。","en":"Coming up to the roof alone was all well and good, but...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900860","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00001","en":"So, I came to the roof alone and that's fine, but,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000012c:text","row":36096,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"どうしようかな。","en":"Now what?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900861","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00002","en":"what should I do?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000154:text","row":36097,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"あ、先輩だ。","en":"Oh. Mimi.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900862","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00003","en":"Ah, there's Senpai.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000019d:text","row":36098,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぱららららららっ」","en":"“Brrratatatatat!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900863","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00004","en":"Misato: \"Budda-budda-budda-budda-budda-budda!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000001c9:text","row":36099,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"サバゲーの練習してる。","en":"She was practicing for airsoft.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900864","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00005","en":"Training for a Survival Game.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000001f7:text","row":36100,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"ＳＭＧを腰だめに構えた先輩は素敵だ。","en":"Mimi looked magnificent with an SMG braced at her hip.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900865","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00006","en":"Senpai is lovely when ready to shoot her SMG from the hip.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000233:text","row":36101,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"ちなみにこの銃器は、毎年の合宿で使われていたものだ。","en":"These guns, incidentally, were used at the club camp every year.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900866","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00007","en":"That gun, by the way, is something used in our yearly training camp.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000027f:text","row":36102,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"無線、合宿ときたらあとはサバゲー。","en":"Radios, camp—and naturally, airsoft came next.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900867","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00008","en":"For radios, when it comes to training camp, it's gotta be survival games.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000002b9:text","row":36103,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"ちゃんとＢＢ弾タイプの電動ガンも揃っている。","en":"They even had a full set of electric airsoft guns that fired BBs.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900868","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00009","en":"We also have proper BB gun type electric guns.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000003fc:text","row":36104,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「はろー」","en":"“Hellooo.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900869","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00010","en":"Taichi: \"Hullooo.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000004a4:text","row":36105,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「えっ？」","en":"“Huh?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900870","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00011","en":"Misato: \"EH?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000004c6:text","row":36106,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"こっちを向いた。","en":"She turned toward me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900871","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00012","en":"She turned my way.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000004ee:text","row":36107,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"ＳＭＧが水を噴出した。","en":"The SMG shot a stream of water.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900872","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00013","en":"The SMG bursts water.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000524:text","row":36108,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「わっぷ！」","en":"“Bwah!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900873","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00014","en":"Taichi: \"WaH'ph!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000548:text","row":36109,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"目と目の間を直撃。","en":"It hit me squarely between the eyes.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900874","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00015","en":"Direct hit the space between eye and eye.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000572:text","row":36110,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"電動水鉄砲だから勢いは強い。","en":"Electric water guns packed a punch.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900875","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00016","en":"It's an electric water pistol so the blast power's strong.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000005cb:text","row":36111,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「あっ、ごめんなさい……」","en":"“Oh! I'm sorry...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900876","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00017","en":"Misato: \"Ah, apologies...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000605:text","row":36112,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「いえ、夏のサバゲーはウォーターガンに限りますよね」","en":"“No, no. Summer airsoft calls for water guns, right?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900877","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00018","en":"Taichi: \"No need, our Summer survival games are limited to water guns.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["idiom_calque","word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000006d7:text","row":36113,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「そういえば新製品が出たんですよ、滅亡前に」","en":"“Come to think of it, they released a new model just before the world ended.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900878","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00019","en":"Misato: \"Which reminds me, a new line of products was released right before the Fall.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["overinterpretation","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000723:text","row":36114,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「寒すぎる……」","en":"“That's cold...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900879","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Way too cold...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000753:text","row":36115,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「あのー、そういえば気になっていたんですけど」","en":"“Actually, there's something I've been wondering.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900880","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00021","en":"Taichi: \"Uhm, which reminds me, it has been on my mind, but,\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000081f:text","row":36116,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい？」","en":"“Yes?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900881","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00022","en":"Misato: \"Yes?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000849:text","row":36117,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「アンテナ、手つけなくていいんですか？」","en":"“Shouldn't we be working on the antenna?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900882","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00023","en":"Taichi: \"Leaving the antenna, without even laying hand on it, is it right?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000090f:text","row":36118,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………そ、そうでした」","en":"“............R-right.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900883","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00024","en":"Misato: \"......w-, well, is it indeed.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese is Misato remembering and conceding: 'Oh, that's right.' The English instead sounds like a doubtful question about whether the claim is true.","remedy":"...O-oh, that's right.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":37,"start":19,"text":"well, is it indeed"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000949:text","row":36119,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希のペースにほだされましたね」","en":"“Miki swept you right along, huh?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900884","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00025","en":"Taichi: \"We have been lovingly suckered into Miki's pace, have we.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["addition","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000009a8:text","row":36120,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「襲ってきたからつい応戦してしまいました……」","en":"“She attacked, so I couldn't help returning fire...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900885","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00026","en":"Misato: \"She suddenly attacked therefore I unconsciously accepted her challenge...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000009ee:text","row":36121,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"と―――","en":"And then—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900886","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00027","en":"And---","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000b04:text","row":36122,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「ＧＩダーイ！」","en":"“GI, DIE!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900887","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00028","en":"Miki: \"G.I. DIE!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000b2c:text","row":36123,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"吶喊(とっかん)してきた。","en":"She charged us with a battle cry.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00029","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00029","en":"She made a battle cry.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000b64:text","row":36124,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「ＧＩじゃねーっての！」","en":"“I told you, I'm not a GI!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900888","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00030","en":"Taichi: \"G.I. we ain't!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000b94:text","row":36125,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"応戦する俺。そして先輩。","en":"Mimi and I opened fire.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900889","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00031","en":"I respond to her fire. Then so does Senpai.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000bc4:text","row":36126,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"水鉄砲が火を噴いた。%N※水鉄砲が火を噴いた＝気にするな","en":"The water guns spat fire.%N*Water guns ‘spitting fire’—never mind.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-unowned-semantic-group:061","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00032","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc4006:00032"],"en":"The water guns breathed fire.\n* \"The water guns breathed fire\" = don'tcha worry 'bout it.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-unowned-semantic-group:061","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0265:00000bc4:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000c1a:text","row":36127,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「ベトナムコンプレックスどもめが！」","en":"“You Viet-con artists!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900890","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00033","en":"Taichi: \"Damn you Vietnam Complex!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","wrong_subject","wordplay"],"assessment":"The Japanese insult addresses the group as people with a 'Vietnam complex.' The English instead appears to address the abstract complex itself and loses the plural human target of the joke.","remedy":"Damn you Vietnam-complex freaks!","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":34,"start":9,"text":"Damn you Vietnam Complex!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000c7b:text","row":36128,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「ＧＩダーイっ！！」","en":"“GI, DIIIE!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900891","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00034","en":"Miki: \"G.I. DIIIE!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000caf:text","row":36129,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺をＧＩと呼ぶなぁー！」","en":"“Stop calling me a GI!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900892","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00035","en":"Taichi: \"DON'T YOU CALL ME G.I.!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000d04:text","row":36130,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「死ねー！」","en":"“Die!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900893","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00036","en":"Kiri: \"DIEEE!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000d30:text","row":36131,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「おわっ」","en":"“Whoa!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900894","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00037","en":"Taichi: \"Bwah?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000d52:text","row":36132,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"くそ、なんか半分本気だな、こっちは。","en":"Damn. I was starting to get half serious myself.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900895","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00038","en":"Crap, am I half-serious or what.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000d96:text","row":36133,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「ベトナムコンシャスの猿め……死ぬのはおまえだ！」","en":"“You Viet-conceited ape... You're the one who dies!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900896","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00039","en":"Taichi: \"Damn you Vietnam Conscious apes... you will be ones who die!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000de0:text","row":36134,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"俺はベトコンの正しい意味を知らなかった！","en":"I had no idea what ‘Viet Cong’ actually meant!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900897","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00040","en":"I didn't actually know what 'Vietcong' meant!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000e43:text","row":36135,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「くっ、こしゃく……」","en":"“Hmph. Impudent...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900898","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00041","en":"Kiri: \"Ngh, impudent...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000e79:text","row":36136,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「お前がな！」","en":"“You're one to talk!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900899","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00042","en":"Taichi: \"And you ain't!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese retort means 'You're one to talk' or 'You're the impudent one.' The English negative instead denies an unspecified predicate and does not return the accusation.","remedy":"You're one to talk!","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":23,"start":9,"text":"And you ain't!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000e9f:text","row":36137,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"水鉄砲の火線が交差する。%N※水鉄砲の火線が交差する＝気にするな","en":"The water guns' lines of fire crossed.%N*Water-gun ‘lines of fire’—never mind.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-unowned-semantic-group:062","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00043","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc4006:00043"],"en":"The lines of fire of the water guns crossed.\n* \"The lines of fire of the water guns crossed\" =\ndon'tcha worry 'bout it.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-unowned-semantic-group:062","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0265:00000e9f:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000f1a:text","row":36138,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「停学、停学っ！」","en":"“Suspension! Suspension!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900900","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00044","en":"Misato: \"Suspension, suspension!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000f69:text","row":36139,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「うりゃー！」","en":"“Hyaaah!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900901","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00045","en":"Miki: \"uRy'aaah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000f8f:text","row":36140,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"また部活が……。","en":"There goes the club again...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900902","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00046","en":"Again club activities, but...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00000fb7:text","row":36141,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"と思いつつも、目の前の敵を無視することはできない。","en":"That thought crossed my mind, but I couldn't ignore the enemy in front of me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900903","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00047","en":"Despite what I may be thinking, I am unable to ignore the enemy in front of my eyes.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001009:text","row":36142,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「くっ、弾（水）切れ！？」","en":"“Damn, out of ammo—I mean water!?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900904","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00048","en":"Taichi: \"Ngh, out of bullets (water)?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000103b:text","row":36143,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"腰に装着したタンクから、弾薬をリロードする。","en":"I reloaded from the ammo tank strapped to my waist.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900905","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00049","en":"I reload my ammunition from the tank equipped on my waist.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000107f:text","row":36144,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"きっちり十秒かかる。","en":"It took exactly ten seconds.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900906","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00050","en":"Precisely ten seconds required.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000010ce:text","row":36145,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「……フッ」","en":"“...Heh.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900907","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00051","en":"Kiri: \"...hoh!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000010f2:text","row":36146,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"霧に邪悪に微笑む。","en":"I gave Kiri a wicked grin.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900908","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00052","en":"Kiri smiles wickedly,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000111c:text","row":36147,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"正確な射撃を加えてきた。","en":"She kept up a precise stream of fire.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900909","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00053","en":"and complemented that with accurate marksmanship.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000114c:text","row":36148,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"身を低くして走る。","en":"I ducked low and ran.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900910","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00054","en":"I do a crouch run.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001176:text","row":36149,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"そう簡単には当たらない。","en":"I wasn't an easy target.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900911","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00055","en":"She won't hit me that easily,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000011a6:text","row":36150,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"だが十秒は長い。","en":"But ten seconds is forever.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900912","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00056","en":"but ten seconds are long.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000011ce:text","row":36151,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"霧が確実に当てるため、接近してきていた。","en":"Kiri closed in to make sure she hit me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900913","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00057","en":"Kiri comes closer, to hit me more reliably,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000120e:text","row":36152,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"ちょうどリロード完了。","en":"The reload clicked home just in time.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900914","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00058","en":"precisely as I finish reloading.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000123c:text","row":36153,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"撃つ。","en":"I fired.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900915","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00059","en":"Fire.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000127d:text","row":36154,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「……あっ！？」","en":"“...Ah!?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900916","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00060","en":"Kiri: \"...ah?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000012a5:text","row":36155,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"霧が転倒した。いいぞ！","en":"Kiri went down. Yes!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900917","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00061","en":"Kiri was fell. Nice one!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000012d3:text","row":36156,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"もう一撃。","en":"One more shot.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900918","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00062","en":"One more shot.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000012f5:text","row":36157,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"これも外れたが、霧はさらに体勢を崩した。","en":"That missed too, but it threw Kiri even further off balance.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900919","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00063","en":"That also successful, Kiri's posture collapses even more.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese explicitly says the second shot also missed, although Kiri lost her balance further. The English calls the shot successful, reversing the result.","remedy":"That one missed too, but Kiri lost her balance even further.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":20,"start":0,"text":"That also successful"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001335:text","row":36158,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"つんのめって、ケンケンをしながらフェンスにしがみつく。","en":"She stumbled forward, hopped on one foot, and grabbed the fence.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900920","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00064","en":"Falling forwards, stumbling on one foot, she grasps at the fence.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001383:text","row":36159,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"フェンスが傾いだ。","en":"The fence tilted.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900921","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00065","en":"The fence tilted.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000013ad:text","row":36160,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"全体重をかけていた霧は、向こう側に折れ曲がるフェンスとともに、横倒しになる。","en":"Kiri had thrown all her weight against the fence, and when it buckled outward, she toppled sideways with it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900922","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00066","en":"Her whole weight put on it, the fence bends down towards the other side, bringing her with it as it falls down.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000014ef:text","row":36161,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧！」","en":"“Kiri!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900923","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00067","en":"Taichi: \"KIRI!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000150f:text","row":36162,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"駆け出す。","en":"I sprinted.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900924","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00068","en":"I run over.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001531:text","row":36163,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"間に合うか。","en":"Would I make it?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900925","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00069","en":"Will I be in time?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001555:text","row":36164,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"無理だ、この距離では。","en":"Not from this distance.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900926","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00070","en":"Impossible, not at this distance.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001583:text","row":36165,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"それがわかってしまった。","en":"I knew it instantly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900927","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00071","en":"I understood that very well.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000015d6:text","row":36166,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ……え……？」","en":"“Ah... huh...?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900928","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00072","en":"Kiri: \"Ah... eh...?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001600:text","row":36167,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"カラカラ、と制服の金具が音を立てる。","en":"Clatter, clatter—the metal fittings on her uniform.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900929","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00073","en":"The metal fixtures of her uniform go clink-clink.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000163c:text","row":36168,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"フェンスの網目と擦れて、そんな音がした。","en":"They scraped against the fence's wire mesh.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900930","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00074","en":"It's the sound they make as they slide over the mesh of the fence.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000167c:text","row":36169,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"滑り落ちる最中の音。","en":"The sound of her sliding down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900931","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00075","en":"It's the sound of something that is sliding off.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000016a8:text","row":36170,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"俺の目の前で、霧が、","en":"Before my eyes, Kiri—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900932","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00076","en":"In front of my eyes, Kiri is,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000016d4:text","row":36171,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"美希が、","en":"Miki—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900933","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00077","en":"Miki is,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000016fc:text","row":36172,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"「っ！？」","en":"“!?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900934","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00078","en":"Taichi: \"?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000171e:text","row":36173,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"迅速と言えた。","en":"She was fast.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900935","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00079","en":"extremely quick, I could say.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001744:text","row":36174,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"美希は手を伸ばす。霧の手首を掴んだ。","en":"Miki lunged and caught Kiri by the wrist.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900936","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00080","en":"Miki extends her hands. She grabbed Kiri's wrist.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001780:text","row":36175,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"間一髪、霧は落下を免れた。","en":"At the last possible instant, Kiri's fall stopped.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900937","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00081","en":"By the breadth of a single hair Kiri has escaped her fall.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000018a4:text","row":36176,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"「……霧」","en":"“...Kiri.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900938","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00082","en":"Miki: \"...Kiri.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000018c6:text","row":36177,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"フェンスを掴んだ腕は、針金で引き裂かれて出血していた。","en":"The arm Miki had braced against the fence was torn open on the wire and bleeding.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900939","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00083","en":"The arm that had grabbed the fence was torn up by the wiring and was bleeding.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001914:text","row":36178,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"当の霧はまだぽかんとしていた。","en":"Kiri still stared blankly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900940","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00084","en":"Kiri herself was still shell-shocked.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000194a:text","row":36179,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"……………………。","en":".........................","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900941","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00085","en":"............","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001a59:text","row":36180,"ordinal":86,"kind":"text","jp":"霧を引き上げる。","en":"We pulled Kiri back up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900942","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00086","en":"Kiri is dragged up.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001a81:text","row":36181,"ordinal":87,"kind":"text","jp":"しばらく、呆然と自失していた。","en":"For a while, Kiri sat there in a daze.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900943","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00087","en":"For a while, she stayed dazed and stupefied.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001b4f:text","row":36182,"ordinal":88,"kind":"text","jp":"「いったたたたぁ～」","en":"“Owowowow...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900944","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00088","en":"Miki: \"OwChChChCh～!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001b7b:text","row":36183,"ordinal":89,"kind":"text","jp":"出血がひどい。","en":"The bleeding was bad.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900945","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00089","en":"Her bleeding is horrible.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001ba9:text","row":36184,"ordinal":90,"kind":"text","jp":"「これは保健室に行かないと……先輩、そっちの方、お願いします」","en":"“We need to get that to the nurse's office... Mimi, can you take her?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900946","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00090","en":"Taichi: \"You gotta go to the infirmary for this... Senpai, if you could be so kind, please.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["omission","undertranslation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001c85:text","row":36185,"ordinal":91,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい」","en":"“Yes.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900947","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00091","en":"Misato: \"Yes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001d2b:text","row":36186,"ordinal":92,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、保健室には先輩と行きますっ」","en":"“Oh, I'll go to the nurse's office with you!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900948","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00092","en":"Miki: \"Ah, I'll go to the infirmary with Senpai!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001d73:text","row":36187,"ordinal":93,"kind":"text","jp":"「え……だめです、私そういうの……ぺけくんお願いしますっ」","en":"“Oh... no, I can't handle that sort of thing... X, please!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900949","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00093","en":"Misato: \"Eh... no good, that is what I... Peke-kun, if you would, please!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001dcd:text","row":36188,"ordinal":94,"kind":"text","jp":"「へーい」","en":"“Okaaay.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900950","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00094","en":"Taichi: \"Ye-es.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001e75:text","row":36189,"ordinal":95,"kind":"text","jp":"「あっ、わたし自分で行けるかも」","en":"“Oh! Maybe I can make it there by myself.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900951","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00095","en":"Miki: \"Ah, should I just go to by myself then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001eb5:text","row":36190,"ordinal":96,"kind":"text","jp":"「手当ては無理でしょ」","en":"“You can't bandage that yourself.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900952","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00096","en":"Taichi: \"You can't handle this medical stuff you know.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001f69:text","row":36191,"ordinal":97,"kind":"text","jp":"「あーう」","en":"“Aww.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900953","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00097","en":"Miki: \"Awww.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001f8b:text","row":36192,"ordinal":98,"kind":"text","jp":"俺も血は苦手だ。","en":"I wasn't good with blood either.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900954","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00098","en":"Blood's also weak point of mine.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00001fbb:text","row":36193,"ordinal":99,"kind":"text","jp":"「ま、まぁ、なんとかするって」","en":"“W-well, I'll manage somehow.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900955","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00099","en":"Taichi: \"W-, well, we'll do this, someway or another.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000205a:text","row":36194,"ordinal":100,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“........................”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900956","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00100","en":"Miki: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00002136:text","row":36195,"ordinal":101,"kind":"text","jp":"美しい血。","en":"Beautiful blood.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900957","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00101","en":"Beautiful blood.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:00002158:text","row":36196,"ordinal":102,"kind":"text","jp":"友達を助けた。","en":"It had been spilled saving a friend.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900958","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00102","en":"A friend was rescued.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["wrong_subject","undertranslation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000217e:text","row":36197,"ordinal":103,"kind":"text","jp":"心は疼かなかった。","en":"My heart didn't ache.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900959","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00103","en":"The heart did not throb.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000021a8:text","row":36198,"ordinal":104,"kind":"text","jp":"これなら平気かも知れない。","en":"Maybe this wouldn't bother me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900960","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00104","en":"This will be alright, perhaps.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:000021da:text","row":36199,"ordinal":105,"kind":"text","jp":"俺たちが校舎内に入る時、霧がぺたりとへたり込むのが見えた。","en":"As we entered the building, I saw Kiri crumple to the ground.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900961","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00105","en":"The moment we entered the school building I saw Kiri flopping down, sitting hard on the floor.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0265:0000222c:text","row":36200,"ordinal":106,"kind":"text","jp":"恐怖は遅れてやってくる。いつだって。","en":"Fear always arrives late. Always.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900962","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4006:00106","en":"Terror is late to come. Always, ever.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
